<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">ADHERENCE REVIEW</view><view class="title">先看异常，再看全部记录</view><view class="subtitle">AI把宠主的重复记录整理成趋势和待复核项，不替医生下诊断结论。</view></view><view class="periods"><button class="{{period===7?'primary':'secondary'}}" data-days="7" bindtap="selectPeriod">7天</button><button class="{{period===30?'primary':'secondary'}}" data-days="30" bindtap="selectPeriod">30天</button><button class="{{period===90?'primary':'secondary'}}" data-days="90" bindtap="selectPeriod">90天</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{items.length}}"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="pet_id" class="card"><view class="row"><view><view class="list-title">{{item.pet_name}}</view><view class="meta">完成 {{item.completed}} / {{item.scheduled}} 项 · 打卡 {{item.checkins}} 次</view></view><view class="pill">{{item.risk_label}}</view></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="meta">AI摘要：{{item.summary}}<br/>医生下一步：{{item.doctor_action}}</view></view></view><view wx:else class="card empty">该周期没有本院授权病例记录。</view><view class="bottom-note">IRIS分期不能由家庭打卡自动改变，仍需稳定水合状态下的检验资料和医生确认。</view></view>
